# This folder contains student records (student/, grades/, exam PDFs), so the
# default is to ignore EVERYTHING and re-include only what we mean to track.
# Add new tracked paths as explicit `!` rules below.

*

!.gitignore
!LICENSE

# Syllabus sources only — the .docx files are generated by build_docx.py and
# the PDFs belong to other instructors, so neither is tracked.
!syllabus/
syllabus/*
!syllabus/*.md
!syllabus/build_docx.py
